Contains Milk", "lifestyles": "Gluten free verified, Protein source, SNAP EBT eligible, Low sodium", "long_desc": "Frosvik Skyr Wild Blueberry Icelandic-Style Strained Lowfat Yogurt honors a northern dairy tradition passed down through generations of farmhouses along the fjords. Our dairy didnt want a thin, over-sugared cup to carry that heritage forward, so we build each batch with fewer ingredients and a slow strain that concentrates the milk itself. Every tub in this six-pack uses roughly four times the milk of an ordinary cup, giving you a dense, protein-forward spoonful that holds its shape. Thick and velvety, its suited to a quick breakfast, a mid-shift snack, or a small treat after a long walk. Skyr starts out naturally fat free, and in keeping with old farmhouse habit we fold a touch of cream back in for a softer, rounder bite. Free of gluten and certified kosher, this blueberry batch pairs well with oats, toasted nuts, or a drizzle of honey, or simply eat it straight from the cup.</br>• Six 4.4-ounce cups of Frosvik Skyr Wild Blueberry Icelandic-Style Lowfat Yogurt</br>• Built with fewer ingredients and nothing artificial</br>• 13g of high-quality protein in every cup to help you stay satisfied</br>• Thick, creamy lowfat skyr folded with real blueberries</br>• Each cup uses about 4x the milk of a standard cup of yogurt for a denser, protein-rich bite</br>• Skyr starts naturally fat free, so we stir a touch of cream back in for extra body, an old farmhouse habit</br>• Spoon it straight from the cup or stir into a bowl with your favorite toppings</br>• Frosvik Skyr was started to make a simple, not-too-sweet yogurt that still tastes like a treat</br>• Explore our other skyr flavors and formats across the Frosvik Skyr line</br>• Gluten-free and kosher</br>• Six cups packed together, ready to share or stash for the week", "nutrition_panels": "Serving size 1 container; Servings 0; Contains Kosher, Low Fat, Gluten Free, Milk, Gluten; Calories 110kcal; Total Fat 2